<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-w-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #e60023; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 style="color: #e60023;">Welcome to Picify! 🎉</h1>
    </div>
    <p>Hi {{displayName}},</p>
    <p>Thanks for joining Picify, the visual discovery engine. We're so excited to have you on board!</p>
    <p>Get started by exploring topics that interest you and creating your first board.</p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn">Start Exploring</a>
    </div>
    <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email.</p>
    <p>Happy pinning!</p>
    <p>— The Picify Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
